WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.417
(drum music)

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:04.620
- Philip, stop.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:07.020
We're not supposed to be
doing that after 6:00 PM.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.040
- Who says?

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.450
- Our HOA?

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.880
It says so clearly in the CC&amp;Rs

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.890
- The Credence Clearwater Revival?

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:16.620
- Covenants, conditions and restrictions.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.453
- Give me a break.

00:00:17.453 --> 00:00:18.540
This is America.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.677
Nobody can tell an adult what
they can do in their own home.

00:00:21.677 --> 00:00:24.252
- Actually, they can.

00:00:24.252 --> 00:00:26.919
(upbeat music)

00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:35.970
There are so many important
factors to consider when

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.040
buying a house from mortgage terms

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.140
to inspections to school districts.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.070
It's understandable

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:43.440
that some things that don't
seem too important now

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.860
will get neglected only
to bite you down the road.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.940
- One such example is the HOA
or Homeowners Association.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.340
A self-governing board
that oversees a community

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.740
of homeowners, whether
in single family homes,

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.510
townhouses, or condos.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:59.940
HOAs are funded by monthly dues collected

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:03.390
from all members and exist
to keep property values high.

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:04.680
The main ways they do this are

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:07.980
by offering amenities and
enforcing restrictions.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:11.430
- Amenities offered by HOAs
come in many different flavors.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:14.400
A gated community might have
security guards patrolling

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.233
at night.

00:01:15.233 --> 00:01:17.250
A subdivision of tract houses might have

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.540
a community swimming pool

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.670
and a condominium building needs to keep

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:23.730
the elevators working and
the lobby neat and tidy.

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:26.940
- These things all cost
money and the amount of dues

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:30.570
collected will reflect the
extravagance of the amenities.

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:33.600
A simple HOA that offers
a garbage pickup service

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.510
and maintains a playground
might only ask residents

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:40.710
for $150 a month while a
beachfront condo could easily

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:43.544
charge $1,000 a month to operate a spa

00:01:43.544 --> 00:01:44.910
and fitness center.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.460
- You can't opt out of
paying for these amenities.

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:50.490
So before you commit,
make an honest assessment

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:52.710
of whether you'll actually use them.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:55.770
Generally, the services that
make everyday life easier

00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:58.170
like snow shoveling or garbage pickup

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:01.859
are a safer bet than luxuries
like gyms and swimming pools.

00:02:01.859 --> 00:02:06.090
- But restrictions are where
HOAs really flex their muscles.

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:07.890
Do you live for Halloween

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:10.560
and literally count the
days until you can bedeck

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:13.470
your house with all manner
of ghosts and ghoulies?

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:16.050
Better read those CC&amp;Rs pretty closely

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:19.230
because some HOAs may
prohibit holiday decorations

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:23.430
of any kind, let alone the
gory tableau you've dreamed up.

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:25.230
- Maybe your family has three cars,

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.210
but only a two car garage.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:29.340
That's okay, you can
just park the extra one

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:30.480
on the street, right?

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:31.830
Well, that depends.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:35.490
No HOA has jurisdiction
over public streets.

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:39.005
But if the street is private,
like say in a gated community,

00:02:39.005 --> 00:02:42.030
HOA can make rules about
what kinds of vehicles

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:44.190
can park there, for how long

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:47.010
or even prohibit street parking entirely.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.330
They can even dictate

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.990
whether you can park your
car in your own driveway.

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:54.840
- Let's say you've just
inherited the handmade farmhouse

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:57.030
mailbox your grandfather made.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:59.850
Better rethink it as a backyard birdhouse

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:03.600
because your new HOA loves
uniformity above all else.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:05.820
Some even require your roof shingles

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.470
to match your neighbors.

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:10.410
- Other common restrictions
include no parties,

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:13.265
no renters, no flags,
no long-term visitors,

00:03:13.265 --> 00:03:17.220
no pets over 25 pounds or no pets period.

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:19.950
- Okay, but are these
really ironclad rules

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.480
or just guidelines?

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:22.980
If you bent them a little bit,

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.410
how much trouble could
you really get into?

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.570
- The answer, a lot.

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.280
- Courts in many states have determined

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.950
that CC&amp;Rs are legally binding documents

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.110
unless they violate public policies.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:37.020
Depending on the terms,
you could be fined, sued

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.360
or have a lien put on your home.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:43.080
HOAs don't play. One
in Florida confiscated

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.810
80 residents' trash bins
and dropped them off

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:48.990
at a recycling center for
leaving them in plain view

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:53.190
for too long. A man in
California had to pay $70,000

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:56.340
of his HOAs legal expenses
and lost his home.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.360
His crime?

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:00.330
Planting too many rose
bushes in his front yard.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.430
- So if you think you'll
have trouble complying

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.830
with any of your HOA's restrictions

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:08.370
it's best to look elsewhere
rather than risk a showdown.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.860
Conversely, these restrictions might just

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:13.050
be what you're looking for, like say,

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:16.260
if you're deathly afraid of
dogs or have trouble sleeping

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.840
and don't want to be
disturbed by loud neighbors.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.910
- Once you've balanced the amenities

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:23.910
with the restrictions and
dues, there's one more aspect

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:27.210
of your HOA to consider, assessments.

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:30.900
- Sometimes major repairs
are required on shared spaces

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:33.510
like if the community
pool needs resurfacing

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.880
or the elevators need special maintenance

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.610
or the roof of a condo
is damaged in a storm.

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:42.330
In these cases, the HOA may
have the authority to demand

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:45.810
that every member chip in to
pay for the emergency upkeep

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:48.030
which depending on the
problem, and the number

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:51.030
of members can result
in an unexpected levy

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:54.270
in the hundreds or even
thousands of dollars.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.210
- These surprise fees
are known as assessments

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:59.130
and though they can feel onerous

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:01.200
they are not to be taken lightly.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.910
Take for example, the collapse

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.610
of the Champlain Towers
South condo building

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.728
in Miami in June of 2021.

00:05:07.728 --> 00:05:11.040
For years before the
tragedy, the condo board knew

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.320
that the building was
in dire need of repair

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:15.330
but was reluctant to ask the residents

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.300
for the 80 to $200,000 in assessments

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.670
it would cost per unit.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.910
- Part of the problem is that
HOA boards are often made up

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:27.450
of volunteer members who have
little experience in finance

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:30.210
or construction and are
under pressure from residents

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:32.910
to keep dues as low as possible.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:36.016
According to one study, about
one third of such associations

00:05:36.016 --> 00:05:39.420
have less than a third of
the savings they'd need

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:42.810
to pay for sudden, but eventual repairs.

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:45.720
- As Jeffrey Ducker, a principal
in the audit department

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:48.210
of a Florida public
accounting firm, put it,

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:51.690
if you're looking to buy a
home in an HOA, be sure to ask

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:54.000
for a copy of its financial statements.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.740
Look at what its liquidity is,

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:58.080
if it has sufficient
working capital to operate

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:01.830
and if it has set aside reserves
for future major repairs

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.380
and replacement. If it
doesn't have reserves

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.810
that would be considered
a negative factor.

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:08.820
- Despite the cost and the pitfalls,

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.550
HOAs are actually pretty popular.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:15.014
The Community Associations
Institute reports that 85%

00:06:15.014 --> 00:06:19.110
of residents that have an
HOA are satisfied with it.

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:22.260
Additionally, researchers at
the University of California

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.840
at Irvine found that homes with an HOA

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:28.950
sold for 4% more than
those without on average.

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:29.940
For many people,

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.790
HOAs can make their home
a better place to live

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.800
and a safer investment.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.960
As long as you have a competent board

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:40.620
and can abide by the restrictions,
you might be one of them.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.360
- So I can go back to
practicing the drums?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:46.140
- Only between the hours of 10 and six

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:49.500
or you could get an electric
kit and put on some headphones

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.683
which actually sounds
like a good idea to me.

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:56.040
- [Group] And that's our two cents.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.480
- Thanks to our patrons

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.180
for keeping "Two Cents"
financially healthy.

